@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@email = specialist@careops.local
@password = CareOps-Demo-2026!

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Sign in (copy accessToken into token below)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Operations dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SLA-prioritized queue
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/providers?status=UnderReview&page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Provider detail
@providerId = paste-provider-id-here
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/providers/{{providerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Transition workflow
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/providers/{{providerId}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "NeedsInformation",
  "reason": "Please provide an updated declarations page."
}

### Upcoming coverage
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/schedule/shifts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
